PE 770: B-tourism / B旅游

=== Counting bounded tours on a line ===
Positions: 0, 1, ..., N-1 (line)
Constraint: each step moves at most B positions
Goal: visit all positions exactly once (any order)

N=1:
  B=1: 1 tours
  B=∞: 1 tours (=N!)

N=2:
  B=1: 2 tours
  B=2: 2 tours
  B=∞: 2 tours (=N!)

